{
  "name": "HSC-01 - Push Lead to HubSpot [Dev]",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-readme",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-460, -280],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 380,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## HSC-01 - Push Lead to HubSpot [Dev]\n\n**Owned By:** Ronny Kalaksanan\n**Last Updated:** 2026-08-18\n\n**Description:**\nMengirim data lead baru dari trigger manual/form ke HubSpot Contacts lewat Private App Token. Bagian dari project portofolio n8n <-> HubSpot.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. TriggerManualTest - trigger uji coba\n2. PrepareLeadPayload - isi data lead contoh\n3. ValidateLeadSchema - validasi field wajib\n4. PushContactToHubSpot - POST ke HubSpot Contacts API (retry 3x)\n5. LogSyncResult - catat hasil sinkronisasi\n\n**Dependencies:**\n- Credential: \"HubSpot Private App Token\" (Header Auth, Authorization: Bearer <token>)\n- ErrorHandler [Global] workflow (belum disambungkan di iterasi ini - next step)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "trigger-manual",
      "name": "TriggerManualTest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-460, 40],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "set-payload",
      "name": "PrepareLeadPayload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-220, 40],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "a1", "name": "email", "type": "string", "value": "test.lead@example.com" },
            { "id": "a2", "name": "firstname", "type": "string", "value": "Test" },
            { "id": "a3", "name": "lastname", "type": "string", "value": "Lead" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "code-validate",
      "name": "ValidateLeadSchema",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [20, 40],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Validasi manual field wajib. Ganti dengan Zod-style schema check kalau butuh validasi lebih kompleks.",
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\nconst requiredFields = ['email', 'firstname', 'lastname'];\nconst missing = requiredFields.filter(f => !item[f] || String(item[f]).trim() === '');\n\nif (missing.length > 0) {\n  throw new Error(`ValidateLeadSchema: field wajib kosong -> ${missing.join(', ')}`);\n}\n\nif (!/^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(item.email)) {\n  throw new Error('ValidateLeadSchema: format email tidak valid');\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: item }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http-push",
      "name": "PushContactToHubSpot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [260, 40],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v3/objects/contacts",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"properties\": { \"email\": $json.email, \"firstname\": $json.firstname, \"lastname\": $json.lastname } } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "HubSpot Private App Token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set-log-success",
      "name": "LogSyncResult",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [520, -60],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "l1", "name": "status", "type": "string", "value": "success" },
            { "id": "l2", "name": "syncedAt", "type": "string", "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set-log-error",
      "name": "LogSyncError",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [520, 160],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "e1", "name": "status", "type": "string", "value": "failed" },
            { "id": "e2", "name": "error", "type": "string", "value": "={{ $json.error?.message || 'Unknown error from HubSpot API' }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "TriggerManualTest": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "PrepareLeadPayload", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "PrepareLeadPayload": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "ValidateLeadSchema", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "ValidateLeadSchema": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "PushContactToHubSpot", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "PushContactToHubSpot": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "LogSyncResult", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "LogSyncError", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
